          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148030,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Marque o código que pertence a essas funções.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"114\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"healPlayer\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player healed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"spawnEnemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spawned&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"healPlayer();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>{</code> seguido de <code>}</code> e depois <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148031,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que criamos funções?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Agrupar e reutilizar código relacionado</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Para separar código relacionado</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Para facilitar a criação de variáveis</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Agrupar e reutilizar código relacionado.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148032,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que acontece quando chamamos uma função?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O código dentro da função é executado</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Todo o código dentro da função é armazenado em uma variável</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Um loop while é criado dentro da função</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O código dentro da função é executado.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148033,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Conclua chamando a função codificando seu nome.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"115\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot; points&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score + label);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayScore();}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>displayScore</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148034,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"startLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"startLevel();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level started&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code> em uma linha e <code>Level started</code> na próxima</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Level started</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>1</code> em uma linha e <code>Level started</code> na próxima.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148035,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é o parâmetro nesta função?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addItemToInventory\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"item\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(text + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>item</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>text</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Não há parâmetro</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>item</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148036,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chame a função e passe um valor para ela.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option startIndex=\"117\" endIndex=\"118\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"removeItemFromInventory\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"item\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Dropped: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"removeItemFromInventory(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Health Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>removeItemFromInventory</code> seguido de <code>\"Health Potion\"</code> e finalmente <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148037,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para que servem os parâmetros?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Os parâmetros nos ajudam a passar informações específicas para as funções</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Parâmetros facilitam a chamada de funções</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Os parâmetros nos permitem exibir variáveis no console</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Os parâmetros nos ajudam a passar informações específicas para as funções.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148038,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione um parâmetro à função e depois chame-a com um valor.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"115\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"updatePlayerHealth\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player health:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(health);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updatePlayerHealth(\" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>health</code> seguido de <code>60</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148039,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Conclua a chamada da função.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"94\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"amount\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot; points&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(amount + label);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"addScore(\" /><text value=\"250\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>addScore</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148040,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que acontece quando adicionamos um valor de retorno a uma função?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A função retorna um valor para o código que a chama</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A função não pode mais usar declarações de exibição</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Isso significa que só poderemos chamar a função uma vez</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A função retorna um valor para o código que a chama.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148041,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como acabamos retornando <code>undefined</code> da nossa função?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ao esquecer de adicionar a declaração <code>return</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ao não incluir nenhuma instrução de exibição em nosso código</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Chamando a função com um parâmetro</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ao esquecer de adicionar a declaração <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148042,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crie uma variável <code>result</code> e armazene o resultado de chamar a função com um valor dentro dela.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"81\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isBossLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level &gt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = isBossLevel(\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>const</code> seguido de <code>result</code> e depois <code>isBossLevel</code>, <code>14</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148043,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Retorne a variável desta função.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"65\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getPlayerHealth\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health = \" /><text value=\"67\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPlayerHealth());}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>health</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
